---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import mentorImg from '../assets/images/foto-mentor.png';

export interface Props {
  lang: 'en' | 'es';
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
---

<!-- MENTOR / STORY SECTION -->
<section id="mentor" class="relative bg-card text-primary py-16 overflow-hidden border-t border-primary/10">
  <!-- HUGE Background Typography -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-full text-center pointer-events-none z-0">
    <p class="text-[12vw] font-heading font-black leading-none opacity-5 text-dark tracking-widest whitespace-nowrap">
      ANALÍA
    </p>
    <p class="text-[12vw] font-heading font-black leading-none opacity-5 text-dark tracking-widest whitespace-nowrap -mt-4 md:-mt-6">
      CAMARDA
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center">
    <!-- Label + Title ABOVE the image -->
    <div class="text-center mb-10 w-full max-w-5xl">
      <div class="font-outfit flex justify-center items-center gap-2 text-cta text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">
        <span>✦</span>
        {lang === 'en' ? 'Learn from an expert' : 'Aprende de una experta'}
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-5xl font-heading text-primary">
        {lang === 'en' ? 'Who is your mentor?' : '¿Quién es tu mentora?'}
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Center Image -->
    <div class="relative w-full max-w-lg mb-20 group">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-primary/10 flex rounded-full blur-[80px]"></div>
      <Image
        src={mentorImg}
        class="relative z-10 rounded-full w-64 h-64 md:w-115 md:h-115 mx-auto object-cover hover:scale-105 object-[0%_5%] border-4 border-card shadow-2xl transition-all duration-700"
        alt="Ana Camarda"
        loading="eager"
      />

      <!-- Badges - Responsive positioning -->
      <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-0 md:-left-8 lg:-left-12 inline-flex items-center gap-1 md:gap-2 px-2 md:px-4 py-1.5 md:py-2 rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-card/90 backdrop-blur-md text-[10px] md:text-xs font-bold text-primary shadow-xl z-30 opacity-90">
        <span class="text-cta">✦</span> Miss Deaf Argentina
      </div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-1/4 right-0 md:-right-8 lg:-right-12 inline-flex items-center gap-1 md:gap-2 px-2 md:px-4 py-1.5 md:py-2 rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-card/90 backdrop-blur-md text-[10px] md:text-xs font-bold text-primary shadow-xl z-30 opacity-90">
        <span class="text-cta">✦</span> Tech & Data Alum
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Two columns text -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 max-w-5xl mx-auto w-full">
      <div>
        {lang === 'en' ? (
          <>
            <p class="font-outfit text-base md:text-lg text-dark/80 text-justify mb-4 leading-relaxed">
              Analía (also known as Ana) is recognized for her leadership in accessible digital entrepreneurship across the USA and Latin America. She holds degrees in <strong class="text-primary font-bold">Cybersecurity and Data Analytics</strong>, a Pharmacy license, and advanced certifications in Tactile Communication. Ana completed ASL Protactile Training and is certified in Deaf/Hard of Hearing Interpreting (RID #90570), showing her commitment to accessible communication.
            </p>
            <p class="font-outfit text-base md:text-lg text-dark/80 text-justify leading-relaxed">
              Ana has launched and scaled several digital ventures, helping thousands of entrepreneurs navigate challenges, build strategies, and grow their businesses. She founded the Digital Academy, training hundreds in digital skills and developing programs for financial independence. Ana has been a keynote speaker at major events and is recognized for innovative teaching and dedication to accessible digital education.
            </p>
          </>
        ) : (
          <>
            <p class="font-outfit text-base md:text-lg text-dark/80 text-justify mb-4 leading-relaxed">
              Analía (también conocida como Ana) es reconocida por su liderazgo en el emprendimiento digital accesible en Estados Unidos y en América Latina. Posee títulos en <strong class="text-primary font-bold">Ciberseguridad y Analítica de Datos</strong>, una licencia de farmacia y certificaciones avanzadas en Comunicación Táctil. Ana completó el entrenamiento en ASL Protactile y tiene certificación en Interpretación para Personas Sordas o con Discapacidad Auditiva (RID #90570), lo que demuestra su compromiso con la comunicación accesible.
            </p>
            <p class="font-outfit text-base md:text-lg text-dark/80 text-justify leading-relaxed">
              Ha lanzado y escalado varios emprendimientos digitales exitosos y ha guiado a miles de emprendedores, ayudándoles a superar desafíos, desarrollar estrategias y hacer crecer sus negocios. Fundó la Academia Digital, donde ha formado a cientos en habilidades digitales y ha desarrollado programas para la independencia financiera. Ana ha sido ponente principal en eventos clave y es reconocida por su enseñanza innovadora y su dedicación a la <strong class="text-primary font-bold">educación digital accesible</strong>.
            </p>
          </>
        )}
      </div>

      <div class="pt-10 md:pt-0">
        {lang === 'en' ? (
          <>
            <p class="font-outfit text-base md:text-lg text-dark/80 text-justify mb-3 leading-relaxed">
              Recognized globally by the deaf community, Ana collaborates with leading experts worldwide. Her authority comes from practical experience and the <strong class="text-primary font-bold">ability to simplify complex technology</strong> into actionable knowledge for all.
            </p>
            <p class="font-outfit text-base md:text-lg text-dark/80 text-justify mb-3 leading-relaxed">
              Learning with Ana means having direct access to years of research. The market never stops growing. She knows how to connect digital tools with real-world income.
            </p>
            <p class="font-outfit text-base md:text-lg text-primary font-bold text-justify leading-relaxed">
              Start your journey to passive income today with Ana as your guide. Take your first actionable step in the very first lesson. By the end, you'll see how to make your first passive sale. Each milestone is crafted to show you quick wins and keep you motivated. Don't wait—take action now and move one step closer to real digital freedom! Join Ana and start earning passively today!
            </p>
          </>
        ) : (
          <>
            <p class="font-outfit text-base md:text-lg text-dark/80 text-justify mb-3 leading-relaxed">
              Reconocida mundialmente por la comunidad sorda, Ana colabora con expertos de primer nivel a nivel global. Su autoridad se basa en la experiencia práctica y en su <strong class="text-primary font-bold">capacidad para simplificar conceptos tecnológicos complejos</strong> para todos.
            </p>
            <p class="font-outfit text-base md:text-lg text-dark/80 text-justify mb-3 leading-relaxed">
              Aprender con Ana significa tener acceso directo a años de investigación. El mercado nunca deja de crecer. Ella sabe cómo conectar herramientas digitales con ingresos del mundo real.
            </p>
            <p class="font-outfit text-base md:text-lg text-primary font-bold text-justify leading-relaxed">
              Comienza tu camino hacia los ingresos pasivos hoy con Ana como tu guía. Da tu primer paso accionable en la primera lección. Al final, verás cómo hacer tu primera venta pasiva. Cada hito está diseñado para mostrarte victorias rápidas y mantenerte motivado. No esperes—¡toma acción ahora y acércate un paso más a la verdadera libertad digital! ¡Únete a Ana y comienza a ganar pasivamente hoy!
            </p>
          </>
        )}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16">
      <a
        href={lang === 'en' ? '/en/aboutme' : '/es/sobre-mi'}
        onclick="if(window.trackEvent)window.trackEvent('click_full_story','navigation','mentor_section',1)"
        class="font-outfit text-xl md:text-2xl text-cta hover:text-dark underline underline-offset-8 transition-colors"
      >
        {lang === 'en' ? 'Read my Full Story' : 'Lee mi Historia Completa'}
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>